# Everything in this folder stays on this machine except this file, the
# README, the rules and the parser script. The materials are large (one BDB
# folder alone is ~96 MB, and GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB), and
# several providers ask to be fetched from their own home rather than
# re-hosted. The README records where each one came from, so the folder
# can be rebuilt.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!RULES.md
!KICKOFF-gesenius.md
# Our own code, no source text in it.
!parse_thayer.py
!gesenius_pages.py
!parse_gesenius.py
!align_lxx.py
!test_page_numbers.py
# Gesenius page transcripts, PROGRESS.md and runs.jsonl: our own work from a
# public-domain book, and small.
!lexicons/
!lexicons/gesenius/
!lexicons/gesenius/transcript/
!lexicons/gesenius/transcript/**
